{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122727","id":5223635912,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAqigmw","number":122727,"title":"`GDType`: Consolidate integer constants in property map","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-22T19:46:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T17:21:32Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T16:38:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122727","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122727.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122727.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Follow up of #122596\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n#112596 introduced property maps in `GDType`, which made integer constants exist both in a dedicated integer constant map and the property map.\r\n\r\nLike how it's done with setgets, it should be possible to get the property map, validate that the type is integer constant, then get the integer from its payload.\r\n\r\n## Memory usage test\r\n\r\n- Build command: `scons target=editor linker=mold dev_build=yes optimize=debug debug_symbols=yes werror=yes tests=yes`\r\n\r\nTest script:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tprint(OS.get_static_memory_usage())\r\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\tget_tree().quit()\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn a simple project that just prints `OS.get_static_memory_usage()` then quits, I got the following from running in headless mode:\r\n|Build|Memory usage (bytes)|\r\n|-|-|\r\n|`master`| 88894464|\r\n|PR| 86315132|\r\n\r\nEffectively a reduction of 2.46 MiB.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe aforementioned PR mentions the new maps added over 20MB in RAM usage. This is just my attempt to mitigate part of it, but it could be superseded as soon as someone comes with a better/bigger solution to the problem.","closed_by":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":8,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122727/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}